- Use the app as a secure sex tracker and personal life diary;
- Read articles on sexual health and wellness;
- Use the app as a calorie counter, check the calories that you burned during the sex;
- Discover and use best free 111 Kamasutra positions with high-quality visualization;
- Count the duration of sex;
- Track your heartbeat during sex activity;
- Track most frequently used sex positions;
- Track the number and quality of orgasms;
- Keep notes and pictures of your sexual acts;
