Spice up your sex life and keep your body in a good shape. Just turn on the timer and start your activity. Or you can add information about your intimacy activity on your own. Sex Keeper app will calculate the number of calories burned, based on the data of sex duration and used positions. In addition, you can specify the mood, the number of orgasms, partners, location, add tags, photos and a description of each activity. In the statistics section, you can track your progress for each month or a whole year.

Use the app for Apple Watch to control timer during your sex activity and check your hearbeat, duration and count burned calories. If you will have heart rate too high the app will notice you about it. 

